{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"0647f07d38a02f97aa12e23622b15d49c44b3771403d2bd3f3f7274551b87801","digest":{"component_or_area":"infra/autolander — S2a selection and rebase-routing","key_entities":["infra/autolander/loop.py","infra/autolander/gerrit.py","label:Autosubmit+1","is:submittable","GET /changes/?q=…&o=DETAILED_LABELS","GET /changes/{id}/revisions/current/related","POST /changes/{id}/rebase:chain","POST /changes/{id}/rebase","RebaseInput.rebase_on_behalf_of_uploader","MERGE_FIRST_PARENT_UPDATE","RebarBotNava","ApprovalInfo.date"],"problem_keywords":["autosubmit","selection","rebase routing","fifo ordering","gerrit api","rebase on behalf","change chain","submittable"],"propositions":["Selection must identify the front submittable change/chain bearing Autosubmit+1, ordered FIFO by ApprovalInfo.date (oldest-voted-submittable-first) via GET /changes/?q=label:Autosubmit+1 is:submittable&o=DETAILED_LABELS.","Rebase routing must classify changes via GET /changes/{id}/revisions/current/related and dispatch: multi-member non-merge chains to POST /changes/{id}/rebase:chain, merge changes always to POST /changes/{id}/rebase (MERGE_FIRST_PARENT_UPDATE), single non-merge changes to POST /changes/{id}/rebase.","RebaseInput.rebase_on_behalf_of_uploader=true must preserve the original uploader identity and DCO trailers (Signed-off-by, rebar-ticket) on the rebased patchset while dropping Verified for CI re-run.","Gerrit helper must implement STDLIB-only pattern (no pygerrit2, no src/rebar imports) with HTTP Basic auth for RebarBotNava via SSM-backed password, covering get change, RelatedChanges, rebase, rebase:chain, submit, and DETAILED_LABELS operations.","Unit tests must validate FIFO ordering and merge-vs-chain-vs-single routing against recorded Gerrit JSON.","Live attestation confirms rebase_on_behalf_of_uploader functionality: change #618 rebased to Patch Set 3 preserving uploader and trailers, then merged after earning fresh Verified+1."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785821714421199611,"uuid":"4d0121c1-db56-4344-9315-3297bf742975"}